00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:12.480
we didn't even want to
brush our fucking teeth.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:15.090
I mean, we had no, you know

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:17.163
no sense of like normal, you know?

00:12:18.760 --> 00:12:21.300
So, you know, he comes
and takes us from our mom

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:24.230
