00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:51.350
- [Mark] And $20,000.

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:53.090
- Well the $20,000 into my arm

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:55.123
and their arm and their pipe, my pipe.

00:12:57.760 --> 00:12:58.713
Yeah, one week.

